  "prompt": "Finance is closing March 2025 and wants the deeper promotions that ended that month. From the promotions table, return four columns, in this order: promo_code, promo_name, end_date, discount_pct. Keep only the promotions whose end_date is from 1 March 2025 to 31 March 2025, both days included, and whose discount_pct is 20 or more. end_date is a date with no time of day, and every promotion has an end_date and a discount_pct. Show discount_pct exactly as stored, without rounding. Return one row per promotion. Any row order is fine.",
